<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσραίνω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρᾰνῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					4.6
				</span></i>
			: 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτιρραίνω</span></b> 
			<i>Abh.Berl. Akad.</i><i><span class="en">
				1928(6).12
			</span></i> (Cos, iv B.C):—<i>sprinkle, throw about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μίλτον κύκλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					379
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sprinkle on</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					684
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πολὺ τῇ θύρᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					14.5.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ ὕδατος</span> (partit.
			gen.) <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.418
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620a14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be sprinkled</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμῃ</span>
			<i>with</i> salt, ib.<i><span class="en">
				596a26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mir.</u>
				835b35
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς φλοξί</span>
			<i>upon</i> flames, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.627c
			</span></i>.</div>
